#BTC #ETH The market will never fail those who patiently wait for you, always remember that 99% of opportunities are earned through waiting.

As expected, the US-Iran negotiations have ended in a hasty manner. Friends who have seen my previous analyses know that I never make backhanded comments. The only regret is that I couldn't place a short position above 74000; I only have a base position benefiting from the drop. Although there is regret, it doesn't matter; as long as there's profit, it's good;

Now let's look at the news: Iran and the Americans are just exchanging verbal attacks, both winning nothing; there's nothing to discuss, all garbage information. The world won't let such an oil passage be controlled by a madman. Ah, at this moment, I realize that electric cars are indeed great.

Today I took some time to join a live broadcast and found many friends opening positions in inexplicable places. Although I don't know who said to open them, in such situations, whether going long or short has its own reasons, but at least a reminder to maintain a light position is necessary. Earning anything in this era is not easy; spending money in the market while being reluctant to spend on food and drink is unwise. Without a stop-loss and heavy positions, sometimes you can't bear to see others struggling, so it's better to stay away from the live broadcast;

Let's talk about my judgment on Monday's market. Personally, I lean towards short positions; the good news has already been exhausted, and what remains is bad news. The only variable is that Iran will use a pancake as a toll; it's the only good news, but it can't last;

I will short near 72000 on the pancake, and add to the position at 73698. As long as it doesn't exceed 2% of the total position, I don't need to take a loss; for the second pancake, short at 2235, add to the position at 2268, and control the position like the pancake; the pancake will have strong support at 70000, and I can reduce my position and take profits as I wish. For the second pancake, reduce positions at 2152 and 2103, and take profits;

Today is the first time sharing my personal trading points, which do not represent the community. Please do not take heavy positions; otherwise, I will not be responsible;
